title: "Operator Stack Lab"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Yokota"
    given-names: "Bungaku"
version: 0.8.0
date-released: 2026-09-27
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A browser-based interactive tool for treating image and signal processing as
  an ordered stack of operations, visualizing pointwise function composition,
  applying operations to local images, and exploring simple spatial and
  stochastic operators such as Gaussian Blur and Gaussian Noise.
